SUMMARY:Asheville Crokinole Club
DESCRIPTION:Crokinole Tuesdays at Highland Brewing Taproom\nJoin us every Tuesday in the Taproom for an evening of flicks\, strategy\, and friendly competition! We’re hosting the Asheville Crokinole Club—a community of players who love this classic dexterity board game. \nNever played? No problem! Crokinole is easy to learn and endlessly fun. Players take turns flicking wooden discs across a circular board\, aiming for the high-scoring center zones. The twist? If your opponent has discs on the board\, you must hit one—miss\, and your piece is out! \nWhether you’re a seasoned pro or just curious\, come grab a pint\, meet new friends\, and test your skills.
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/asheville-crokinole-club/2026-10-27/
LOCATION:Taproom At Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Public Events,Recreation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/crokinole1.jpg
END:VEVENT
